<title>FINLAND: Raisio, UPM set up joint venture.</title>
<headline>Raisio, UPM set up joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food and chemicals group Raisio Tehtaat Oy said in a statement on Friday it had agreed with forest industry group UPM-Kymmene Oy to set up a joint venture to develop sterol separation technology.</p>
<p>&quot;Raisio and UPM-Kymmene will be transferring all their know-how in sterol separation and manufacture to Sterol Technologies,&quot; Raisio said, referring to a new company, in which Raision will own 65 percent and UPM-Kymmene 35 percent.</p>
</text>
